From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Corentin Wallez <cwallez@chromium.org>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 01:04:49 -0700
Subject: [dawn][vk] Handle noop draw for AddWorkToEmptyPass workaround.

Move the accounting of work being done to avoid counting it when the
noop draws are skipped.

Adds a test that would fail on Pixel 4 without this fix, except that the
driver on CQ doesn't seem to need the workaround anymore, so this is now
only a speculative fix.

Fixed: 574211718
Change-Id: Ide9d014e1b58cb8d8b70ff064126dc5ea6fd4847
Reviewed-on: https://dawn-review.googlesource.com/c/dawn/+/351916
Commit-Queue: Corentin Wallez <cwallez@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Brandon Jones <bajones@chromium.org>

